# ================================================================
# AVIS.EDU.TEMPLATE
# PURPOSE:
#   Canonical EDU pattern for all AVIS scripts.
#   Robots use this file to learn the AVIS structure.

# REQUIRED STRUCTURE:
#
#   AI.<namespace>.START
#
#       begin.seed
#           begin.spec.<MODULE>.<FUNCTION>
#               <commands>
#           end.spec
#       end.seed
#
#   AI.<namespace>.END
#
# OPTIONAL:
#   begin.control.<ID>
#       <control commands>
#   end.control
#
# NOTES:
#   • win.style uses raw strings
#   • No dot-splitting inside style values
#   • EDU files explain structure, not logic
# ================================================================
